{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43316","headline":"玉烛 · 员南溟","name":"玉烛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历象璿玑正，休徵玉烛明。\n四时佳气满，五纬太阶平。\n律吕风光至，烟云瑞色呈。\n年和知岁稔，道泰喜秋成。\n寰海皇恩被，乾坤至化清。\n自怜同野老，帝力讵能名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"员南溟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43316.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43316","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}